      "text": "February 14-22, 2026 | Natural Disasters Summary \n\nFebruary 14\nInhambane | Mozambique - Tropical Cyclone Gezani made landfall, causing fatalities and massive power outages.\nArequipa | Peru - Torrential rain triggered severe urban flooding.\nAntioquia | Colombia - Intense rainfall caused flash floods and landslides.\n\nFebruary 15\nGuanare | Venezuela - River surge flooded the city during carnival celebrations.\nMarmande | France - Historic river flooding cut off towns and left thousands without power.\nNorth Island | New Zealand - Severe cyclone brought widespread flooding and evacuations.\n\nFebruary 16\nHawaii | USA - Kīlauea eruption produced lava fountains and ash plume up to 10 km.\nKyiv | Ukraine - Heavy snow, strong winds, and snowmelt caused transport chaos and flooding.\nCoquimbo | Chile - Wildfire spread rapidly amid extreme heat.\n\nFebruary 17\nMessina | Italy - Powerful coastal storm damaged embankments and infrastructure.\nValais | Switzerland - Major avalanche narrowly missed a passenger train.\nAnadyr | Russia - Blizzard with hurricane-force winds paralyzed the city.\n\nFebruary 18\nTaubaté | Brazil - Severe thunderstorm caused structural damage and outages.\nAlausí | Ecuador - Mudslide damaged homes and blocked a highway.\nMorowali | Indonesia - Industrial landslide killed one worker.\n\nFebruary 19\nKobuleti | Georgia - Strong Black Sea storm damaged coastal infrastructure.\nBloomington | USA - Destructive tornado damaged homes and businesses.\nCrawford County | USA - Large tornado and hail caused severe damage.\n\nFebruary 20\nWestern Hungary | Hungary - Heavy snowfall and blizzards disrupted transport.\nSabah | Malaysia - Major flooding forced thousands to evacuate.\nLazio | Italy - Hailstorm and heavy rain caused localized flooding.\n\nFebruary 21\nTrnava Region | Slovakia - Magnitude 4.3 earthquake felt near Bratislava.\nAyabaca | Peru - Heavy rains caused casualties and thousands affected.\nMendoza | Argentina - Severe storm with hail flooded neighborhoods.\n\nFebruary 22\nArequipa | Peru - Repeated flooding and mudflows inundated residential areas.\nPadassari | Indonesia - Ongoing landslides displaced thousands.\nMindanao | Philippines - Torrential rains caused urban flooding and disruptions.\n\n#ExtremeWeather #NaturalDisaster #Flooding #Storm #Tornado #Wildfire #Earthquake #Landslide #ClimateEvents #GlobalWeather",
